  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed windows, by reason of their overall design and materials would be unsympathetic and incongruous additions failing to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the host building whilst resulting in less than substantial harm to the wider Wimbledon Park Road Conservation Area without the public benefits to outweigh this harm. The proposal would fail to comply with paragraph 212 of the NPPF (2024), section 72 (1) of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990, policy HC1 (C) and D6  of the London Plan (2021), local policies LP1, LP3 and LP5 of the Local Plan (2023), the SPD 'Housing' (2016) and Wimbledon Park Road Conservation Area Appraisal."
